    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.first_revelation.reference"
  },
  "seerah.story.first_revelation.body": "Before prophethood, Muhammad spent quiet contemplative time in Cave Hira. There, the first revelation came to him. Khadijah (RA) comforted him with courage and stood firmly by his side. Thus began the transmission of the Quranic message.",
  "@seerah.story.first_revelation.body": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.first_revelation.body"
  },
  "seerah.story.first_revelation.lesson": "Give strength to family in difficult times and stand with the truth.",
  "@seerah.story.first_revelation.lesson": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.first_revelation.lesson"
  },
  "seerah.story.zamzam_baby.title": "The Story of Zamzam Water",
  "@seerah.story.zamzam_baby.title": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.zamzam_baby.title"
  },
  "seerah.story.zamzam_baby.subtitle": "The reward of trusting in Allah",
  "@seerah.story.zamzam_baby.subtitle": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.zamzam_baby.subtitle"
  },
  "seerah.story.zamzam_baby.read_time": "3 mins",
  "@seerah.story.zamzam_baby.read_time": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.zamzam_baby.read_time"
  },
  "seerah.story.zamzam_baby.reference": "Sahih Bukhari 3184",
  "@seerah.story.zamzam_baby.reference": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.zamzam_baby.reference"
  },
  "seerah.story.zamzam_baby.body": "Hajar (RA) found herself alone in the desert of Makkah with her infant Ismail. As the water ran out, she ran between the hills of Safa and Marwah searching for water. By Allah's decree, the well of Zamzam sprang from beneath the child's feet.",
  "@seerah.story.zamzam_baby.body": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.zamzam_baby.body"
  },
  "seerah.story.zamzam_baby.lesson": "Trust in Allah even in the greatest hardships; He never abandons us.",
  "@seerah.story.zamzam_baby.lesson": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.zamzam_baby.lesson"
  },
  "seerah.story.kaaba_corner.title": "Arbitration at the Rebuilding of the Kaaba",
  "@seerah.story.kaaba_corner.title": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.kaaba_corner.title"
  },
  "seerah.story.kaaba_corner.subtitle": "Resolving tribal disputes with wisdom",
  "@seerah.story.kaaba_corner.subtitle": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.kaaba_corner.subtitle"
  },
  "seerah.story.kaaba_corner.read_time": "3 mins",
  "@seerah.story.kaaba_corner.read_time": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.kaaba_corner.read_time"
  },
  "seerah.story.kaaba_corner.reference": "Sirat Ibn Hisham",
  "@seerah.story.kaaba_corner.reference": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.kaaba_corner.reference"
  },
  "seerah.story.kaaba_corner.body": "When rebuilding the Kaaba, the tribes argued over who would place the Black Stone. The young Muhammad placed the stone on a cloak and had every tribal leader hold an edge, resolving the conflict peacefully.",
  "@seerah.story.kaaba_corner.body": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.kaaba_corner.body"
  },
  "seerah.story.kaaba_corner.lesson": "Resolve disagreements with wisdom, justice, and collective participation.",
  "@seerah.story.kaaba_corner.lesson": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.kaaba_corner.lesson"
  },
  "seerah.story.khadija_trust.title": "Khadijah (RA)'s Steadfast Faith",
  "@seerah.story.khadija_trust.title": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.khadija_trust.title"
  },
  "seerah.story.khadija_trust.subtitle": "Support and trust in times of distress",
  "@seerah.story.khadija_trust.subtitle": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.khadija_trust.subtitle"
  },
  "seerah.story.khadija_trust.read_time": "3 mins",
  "@seerah.story.khadija_trust.read_time": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.khadija_trust.read_time"
  },
  "seerah.story.khadija_trust.reference": "Sahih Bukhari 3",
  "@seerah.story.khadija_trust.reference": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.khadija_trust.reference"
  },
  "seerah.story.khadija_trust.body": "When the Prophet received revelation and feared for himself, Khadijah reassured him: 'By Allah, Allah will never disgrace you, for you maintain ties of kinship, help the poor, and support the truth.'",
  "@seerah.story.khadija_trust.body": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.khadija_trust.body"
  },
  "seerah.story.khadija_trust.lesson": "Good character and service to humanity earn divine protection and human trust.",
  "@seerah.story.khadija_trust.lesson": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.khadija_trust.lesson"
  },
  "seerah.story.bilal_patience.title": "The Patience of Bilal (RA)",
  "@seerah.story.bilal_patience.title": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.bilal_patience.title"
  },
  "seerah.story.bilal_patience.subtitle": "Steadfastness upon faith under persecution",
  "@seerah.story.bilal_patience.subtitle": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.bilal_patience.subtitle"
  },
  "seerah.story.bilal_patience.read_time": "3 mins",
  "@seerah.story.bilal_patience.read_time": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.bilal_patience.read_time"
  },
  "seerah.story.bilal_patience.reference": "Sunan Ibn Majah 150",
  "@seerah.story.bilal_patience.reference": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.bilal_patience.reference"
  },
  "seerah.story.bilal_patience.body": "Under the scorching desert heat, heavy rocks were placed on Bilal's chest to force him to renounce Islam. Yet his heart remained firm and his tongue repeated: 'Ahad, Ahad' (Allah is One).",
  "@seerah.story.bilal_patience.body": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.bilal_patience.body"
  },
  "seerah.story.bilal_patience.lesson": "True faith cannot be broken by worldly pressure or hardship.",
  "@seerah.story.bilal_patience.lesson": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.bilal_patience.lesson"
  },
  "seerah.story.anas_servant.title": "Ten Years in the Prophet's Care",
  "@seerah.story.anas_servant.title": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.anas_servant.title"
  },
  "seerah.story.anas_servant.subtitle": "Gentleness and compassion toward assistants",
  "@seerah.story.anas_servant.subtitle": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.anas_servant.subtitle"
  },
  "seerah.story.anas_servant.read_time": "2 mins",
  "@seerah.story.anas_servant.read_time": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.anas_servant.read_time"
  },
  "seerah.story.anas_servant.reference": "Sahih Muslim 2309",
  "@seerah.story.anas_servant.reference": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.anas_servant.reference"
  },
  "seerah.story.anas_servant.body": "Anas (RA) served the Prophet for ten years. He said: 'He never once said 'Uff' to me, nor did he ask why I did something or why I failed to do something.'",
  "@seerah.story.anas_servant.body": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.anas_servant.body"
  },
  "seerah.story.anas_servant.lesson": "Treat domestic workers, assistants, and younger ones with immense gentleness.",
  "@seerah.story.anas_servant.lesson": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.anas_servant.lesson"
  },
  "seerah.story.migration_madina.title": "The Hijrah to Madinah",
  "@seerah.story.migration_madina.title": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.migration_madina.title"
  },
  "seerah.story.migration_madina.subtitle": "Trust in Allah and strategic planning",
  "@seerah.story.migration_madina.subtitle": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.migration_madina.subtitle"
  },
  "seerah.story.migration_madina.read_time": "4 mins",
  "@seerah.story.migration_madina.read_time": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.migration_madina.read_time"
  },
  "seerah.story.migration_madina.reference": "Sahih Bukhari 3905",
  "@seerah.story.migration_madina.reference": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.migration_madina.reference"
  },
  "seerah.story.migration_madina.body": "When the Quraysh plotted against the Prophet, he migrated to Madinah with Abu Bakr (RA). Taking refuge in Cave Thawr, Abu Bakr worried, but the Prophet said: 'Do not grieve; indeed Allah is with us.'",
  "@seerah.story.migration_madina.body": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.migration_madina.body"
  },
  "seerah.story.migration_madina.lesson": "Combine careful effort with complete reliance on Allah.",
  "@seerah.story.migration_madina.lesson": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.migration_madina.lesson"
  },
  "seerah.story.badr_dua.title": "The Supplication at Badr",
  "@seerah.story.badr_dua.title": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.badr_dua.title"
  },
  "seerah.story.badr_dua.subtitle": "Turning to Allah with humility before the trial",
  "@seerah.story.badr_dua.subtitle": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.badr_dua.subtitle"
  },
  "seerah.story.badr_dua.read_time": "3 mins",
  "@seerah.story.badr_dua.read_time": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.badr_dua.read_time"
  },
  "seerah.story.badr_dua.reference": "Sahih Muslim 1763",
  "@seerah.story.badr_dua.reference": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.badr_dua.reference"
  },
  "seerah.story.badr_dua.body": "On the eve of the Battle of Badr, the Prophet spent the night in tearful supplication, raising his hands so high his cloak fell. Allah answered and granted victory to the believers.",
  "@seerah.story.badr_dua.body": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.badr_dua.body"
  },
  "seerah.story.badr_dua.lesson": "Supplication is the believer's greatest weapon in any difficulty.",
  "@seerah.story.badr_dua.lesson": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.badr_dua.lesson"
  },
  "seerah.story.conquest_mercy.title": "Mercy at the Conquest of Makkah",
  "@seerah.story.conquest_mercy.title": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.conquest_mercy.title"
  },
  "seerah.story.conquest_mercy.subtitle": "Forgiving those who persecuted you",
  "@seerah.story.conquest_mercy.subtitle": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.conquest_mercy.subtitle"
  },
  "seerah.story.conquest_mercy.read_time": "3 mins",
  "@seerah.story.conquest_mercy.read_time": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.conquest_mercy.read_time"
  },
  "seerah.story.conquest_mercy.reference": "Sunan al-Kubra 18275",
  "@seerah.story.conquest_mercy.reference": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.conquest_mercy.reference"
  },
  "seerah.story.conquest_mercy.body": "When the Prophet entered Makkah victorious, the people who had driven him out and hurt him stood before him. Instead of revenge, he announced: 'Go, for you are free.'",
  "@seerah.story.conquest_mercy.body": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.conquest_mercy.body"
  },
  "seerah.story.conquest_mercy.lesson": "The greatest victory lies in forgiveness, humility, and mercy.",
  "@seerah.story.conquest_mercy.lesson": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.conquest_mercy.lesson"
  },
  "seerah.story.taif_patience.title": "Patience and Forgiveness at Taif",
  "@seerah.story.taif_patience.title": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.taif_patience.title"
  },
  "seerah.story.taif_patience.subtitle": "Praying for guidance for those who hurt you",
  "@seerah.story.taif_patience.subtitle": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.taif_patience.subtitle"
  },
  "seerah.story.taif_patience.read_time": "4 mins",
  "@seerah.story.taif_patience.read_time": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.taif_patience.read_time"
  },
  "seerah.story.taif_patience.reference": "Sahih Bukhari 3231",
  "@seerah.story.taif_patience.reference": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.taif_patience.reference"
  },
  "seerah.story.taif_patience.body": "When the people of Taif stoned the Prophet and injured him, the angel of mountains offered to crush the town. The Prophet replied: 'No, I hope Allah brings from their descendants people who will worship Him alone.'",
  "@seerah.story.taif_patience.body": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.taif_patience.body"
  },
  "seerah.story.taif_patience.lesson": "Wish guidance and good even for those who wrong you.",
  "@seerah.story.taif_patience.lesson": {
    "description": "Translation for seerah.story.taif_patience.lesson"
